# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Use the [`Neat` class](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) to analyze the noise impact on an Estimator workload.\n"
"- Review detailed [Sampler examples](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator examples](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) tutorial.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Doporučení\">\n"
"- Použij třídu [`Neat`](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) k analýze dopadu šumu na pracovní zátěž Estimatoru.\n"
"- Prostuduj si podrobné [příklady Sampleru](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Prostuduj si podrobné [příklady Estimatoru](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Procvič si primitivy v lekci [Funkce nákladů](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) v IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Nauč se transpilovat lokálně v sekci [Transpilace](/guides/transpile).\n"
"- Vyzkoušej tutoriál [Porovnání nastavení Transpileru](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
